Today, 26 members of the Trinitarios gang were indicted for violations of RICO – conspiracy to commit murder. These charges encompass five murders and 19 attempted murders, trafficking of dozens of kilograms of drugs, extortion, kidnapping, and robbery.

Massachusetts communities are safer today thanks to the Homeland Security Task Force.

